# Where to store agent guidance

Follow the root `AGENTS.md` as project-wide agent guidance. Also consult `CLAUDE.md` when working in this repository, and keep both files consistent.

Put new guidance that applies broadly across project work in both `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` by default, rather than creating a separate Cursor rule. Check for equivalent guidance first and update it instead of duplicating it.

Keep guidance out of the shared files only when it is specifically about Cursor behavior, or is deliberately limited to a particular task or file scope and would be unhelpful as a project-wide instruction. If a rule mixes general and narrow guidance, put the general part in both shared files and leave only the narrow part in the Cursor rule.
